| macOS x86_64 (SSE4.2) | 2,500 | 25,000 | **10x** | ⚠️ THEORETICAL |
| macOS ARM64 (Accelerate) | 2,500 | 25,000 | **10x** | ⚠️ THEORETICAL |
| Windows x86_64 (SSE4.2) | 2,500 | 25,000 | **10x** | ⚠️ THEORETICAL |

